<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Silicon Graphics EPS view cut.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Silicon Graphics EPS view cut.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- SoundView Financial said it lowered earnings estimates on Silicon Graphics Inc but left unchanged its ratings on the shares.</p>
<p>-- cut fiscal 1997 earnings estimate to $0.49 per share from $0.85, and cut fiscal 1998 estimate to $1.43 from $1.53.</p>
<p>-- kept short- and long-term hold ratings.</p>
<p>((--Wall Street Desk, 212-859-1730))</p>
</text>
